        "body": "## Summary\n- Adds `+crt-static` to Windows MSVC rustflags in `codex-rs/.cargo/config.toml`\n- Eliminates dependency on `vcruntime140.dll`, `vcruntime140_1.dll`, and `msvcp140.dll`\n- Fixes `STATUS_DLL_NOT_FOUND` (0xC0000135) crash on Windows systems without the Visual C++ Redistributable\n\n## Context\n`codex.exe` was failing immediately on spawn with exit code `3221225781` (`0xC0000135`) on Windows machines that don't have the VC++ Redistributable installed. The MSVC Rust target dynamically links the CRT by default. This change statically links it, producing a self-contained binary.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Build `codex.exe` with `cargo build --target x86_64-pc-windows-msvc --release --bin codex`\n- [ ] Verify no DLL dependencies via `dumpbin /dependents codex.exe` (should only show Windows system DLLs)\n- [ ] Test on a clean Windows install without VC++ Redistributable\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Craft Agent](https://craft.do)",
