        "body": "When using ChatGPT subscription auth, the backend may silently route/fallback to a different model than requested (e.g. requesting gpt-5.3-codex but response.created.response.model reports gpt-5.2-2025-12-11).\n\nThis PR carries response.created model+id through ResponseEvent::Created and emits a user-visible Warning when served != requested.\n\nHelps debugging and reproducibility for #11189.",
